# No Local Git CLI

The user's machine does **not** have `git` or `gh` installed locally. Do not search for installation options or suggest installing them.

## Agent workflow

Use the **Cursor shell** (or cloud agent) for all git operations: branch, commit, push.

For merge/PR links, **build the GitHub URL directly** after push — do not rely on `gh pr create`:

```
https://github.com/omids0/accounting-with-google-sheet/compare/main...<branch-name>?expand=1
```

Replace `<branch-name>` with the pushed branch. Give the user that link as the merge/PR URL.
